146,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69a4Sy","user":{"login":"FrostHex","id":126316318,"node_id":"U_kgDOB4dvHg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126316318?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrostHex","html_url":"https://github.com/FrostHex","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrostHex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrostHex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrostHex/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrostHex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrostHex/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrostHex/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrostHex/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrostHex/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrostHex/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-12T06:51:18Z","updated_at":"2025-08-12T06:51:18Z","body":"> Can you test with 4.4.1? To see if this is an old bug or a regression\n\nThnaks. I tested it with 4.4.1 stable, and it still exists. I think it seems to be an old bug.\nHere is the MRP in 4.4.1 for your review:\n[issue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21728580/issue.zip)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3177940146/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3180364748","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109483#issuecomment-3180364748","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109483","id":3180364748,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69kIPM","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-12T17:40:48Z","updated_at":"2025-08-12T17:40:48Z","body":"This was [reported](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/72331) a while ago, but was fixed in 4.1 by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/78436.\n\nIt's possible the issue came up again at some point in 4.2 or 4.3. Can you test there if possible too?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3180364748/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3190925951","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109483#issuecomment-3190925951","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109483","id":3190925951,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-Map_","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-15T08:20:55Z","updated_at":"2025-08-15T08:20:55Z","body":"I remember looking into this before but a big problem we have with fog rendering is that it was written for desktop rendering. We do a reprojection of the volume data to get stereo output but that always ends up being an approximation.\n\nIt may be required to do a full stereo conversion of the fog logic and create separate volume textures, one for each eye.\n\nNeeds someone with time to look into further. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3190925951/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3776386725","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109483#issuecomment-3776386725","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109483","id":3776386725,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hFxal","user":{"login":"luzader","id":617962,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNzk2Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/617962?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader","html_url":"https://github.com/luzader","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T06:18:03Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T06:18:03Z","body":"I was able to reproduce this by combining my #72331 MRP with @BastiaanOlij's MRP for #84510. I narrowed it to occurring after 4.4.dev3, though the symptoms changed from 4.4dev4 to 4.4dev5.\n\nThis is different from #72331:\n\n- It is only wrong for pixels where there is nothing but sky behind it.\n- It isn't wrong in the sense that stereoscopy is broken, its a different kind of wrong.\n\n| Release | XR Off | XR On |\n| ---------------- | -----------------|-------------|\n| 4.1.1.stable | No Issues | No Issues |\n| 4.2.2.stable | No Issues | No Issues |\n| 4.3.stable | Fog overlapping sky is missing. Renders correctly over other objects. | Fog overlapping sky is missing. Renders correctly over other objects. |\n| 4.4.dev1 | No Issues | No Issues |\n| 4.4.dev2 | No Issues | No Issues |\n| 4.4.dev3 | No Issues | No Issues |\n| 4.4.dev4 | No Issues | Fog over other objects is ok. Left eye fog misplaced horizontally where overlapping sky. Right eye fog missing or extremely displaced where overlapping sky. Right eye sky discolored.  |\n| 4.4.dev5 | No Issues | Left and right eyes are consistent, but fog is rendered in the wrong place vertically where it overlaps the sky. Fog over other objects is ok.|\n| 4.4.1 stable | No Issues | Same Issues as 4.4.dev5 |\n| 4.5 stable | No Issues | Same Issues as 4.4.dev5 |\n| 4.6.dev4 | No Issues | Same Issues as 4.4.dev5 |\n\nScreenshot from 4.4.dev3 below (correct rendering for reference):\n\n<img width=\"2424\" height=\"1504\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b78fcf0e-9111-4d22-8cfa-69f22ceaecb1\" />\n\nScreenshot from 4.4.dev4 below:\n\n<img width=\"2424\" height=\"1504\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ee122c00-00c8-4a0e-841c-08851ee3c395\" />\n\nScreenshot from 4.4.dev5 below:\n\n<img width=\"2424\" height=\"1504\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a3b0f1a4-ab3f-4ca3-ae8d-4d3215ec591b\" />\n\nA video from 4.4.dev5 (the last 10 seconds has actual movement):\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/25fd9356-22d0-4ecf-8a28-c74367cd51be\n\nUpdated MRP (No headset required):\n\n[MRPXRFogVolume.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24757639/MRPXRFogVolume.zip)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3776386725/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3787823262","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109483#issuecomment-3787823262","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109483","id":3787823262,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hxZie","user":{"login":"luzader","id":617962,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNzk2Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/617962?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader","html_url":"https://github.com/luzader","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luzader/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-23T02:22:05Z","updated_at":"2026-01-23T02:22:05Z","body":"The fog volume in the sky is simply y-flipped. Setting the fog volume to a cone makes that more obvious:\n\n<img width=\"1720\" height=\"1168\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/591b78e5-04f6-4d2d-a3c8-b8053a4bfb51\" />\n\nThis is related to #86138 and its fix #99448 which applies a `y_flip` to the `sky_scene_state.cam_projection`.\n\nThe problem lies here: \nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/c3058391d7bd1a13481c393061c164c24ec99685/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/environment/sky.cpp#L1175\nThis is incorrectly using the original (unflipped) projection to compute the multivew reprojection. This reprojection is only used by the `volumetric_fog_process`.\n\nUsing the \"corrected\" projection which was computed a few lines earlier is sufficient to resolve this:\n```\nRendererRD::MaterialStorage::store_camera(sky_scene_state.cam_projection * view_inv_projection, // etc, etc\n```\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3787823262/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]